                                "sense_id": "1c2494c6-df00-336e-b46a-33dd67d03618",
                                "text": "Feminist critiques of continuity discourse have become increasingly audible within the mainstream Jewish world, intensifying last year after [Steven M.] Cohen himself was accused of serial sexual harassment."
                            }
